  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Unfortunately as soon as Sushil reached the sweet shop, he saw there was a huge queue. At first, Sushil joins at the end of the line. But he is impatient and now has decided to bully people in front of him, by flexing his wealth, so that they let him proceed.\n\nThere are NNN people in the line, with the iii-th person having a wealth of Rs. AiA_iAi​. Sushil is currently the NNN-th person in this line.\n\nEverytime Sushil sees that the person directly in front of him has a wealth less than or equal to **half** of his own wealth, Sushil will bully him out of the line, and the queue will reduce by 111. Note that Sushil can only bully the person directly infront of him.\n\nMore formally, if Sushil has wealth XXX, he can bully people with wealth smaller than or equal to X2\\frac{X}{2}2X​. Find the final position of Sushil.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of input contains NNN - the number of people in the queue including Sushil.\nThe second line contains NNN integers - A1,A2,....,ANA_1, A_2, ...., A_NA1​,A2​,....,AN​, the wealths of all the people in the queue.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line the final position of Sushil after he finishes bullying people.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1001 \\le T \\le 1001≤T≤100",
      "2≤N≤1002 \\le N \\le 1002≤N≤100",
      "1≤Ai≤1001 \\le A_i \\le 1001≤Ai​≤100"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n5\n1 4 5 2 10\n3\n2 3 5\n4\n2 10 4 8",
        "output": "1\n3\n3",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 1 : Sushil can bully everybody one by one because his wealth is 101010 and the maximum other weight is only 555. Thus, Sushil reaches position 111 in the queue.\nTest case 2 : Sushil cannot bully the 222nd person in the queue, who is just in front of him. He can bully the 111st person, however he is not directly in front of Sushil."
      }
    ]
  },
